        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d6ef10f7-451b-3789-b2d1-388f8756dfdf",
                "word": "désappointement",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "386e4408-95ee-43c9-9b9f-a8a6ebda97c1",
                        "entry_id": "d6ef10f7-451b-3789-b2d1-388f8756dfdf",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "désappointements"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a87dff09-fe17-3839-998c-4f948c41624c",
                        "entry_id": "d6ef10f7-451b-3789-b2d1-388f8756dfdf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "État de celui qui n’a pas eu ce qu’il espérait."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7481d21-7642-4c85-bec1-0d296446423c",
                                "sense_id": "a87dff09-fe17-3839-998c-4f948c41624c",
                                "text": "Or, la graine de chou colossal n’était que de la graine de niais, et l’on peut se faire une idée du désappointement des innombrables dupes qu’avaient séduites les étourdissantes promesses de l’annonce et des prospectus […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e1bb65f-6371-4d4b-b826-349e37267802",
                                "sense_id": "a87dff09-fe17-3839-998c-4f948c41624c",
                                "text": "[…] si lui, Thomas Black, envoyé dans ce but, ne pouvait observer ni la couronne lumineuse, ni les protubérances rougeâtres, quel désappointement !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f278c63-923e-4b0a-ac7b-a5b1be8836ee",
                                "sense_id": "a87dff09-fe17-3839-998c-4f948c41624c",
                                "text": "Toutefois, Juve jeta un regard de triomphe sur Fandor, et Fandor lui répondit par un coup d’œil de désappointement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1be09f8d-ff7e-43b0-930e-f94644739ed6",
                                "sense_id": "a87dff09-fe17-3839-998c-4f948c41624c",
                                "text": "Elle sortit sans mot dire, au grand désappointement de la gouvernante, qui croyait que la marquise venait lui demander pardon de ses vivacités."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "14d4482b-0701-4e9f-8b2d-4116e7bb3dd2",
                                "sense_id": "a87dff09-fe17-3839-998c-4f948c41624c",
                                "text": "Je partis pour renouveler mes recherches, mais il n’en résulta que du désappointement, et les recherches de Joseph eurent le même effet."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7c4050e0-288c-424b-a317-7299f49c53d2",
                        "source_entry_id": "d6ef10f7-451b-3789-b2d1-388f8756dfdf",
                        "source_sense_id": "a87dff09-fe17-3839-998c-4f948c41624c",
                        "target_lang_word": "disappointment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "disappointment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9a2428e-b8a7-3a89-bd7f-1454d45569cf",
                                        "entry_id": "dd6a4577-aaf3-3efb-9fa3-6728d356e852",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The feeling or state of being disappointed: a feeling of sadness or frustration when something is not as good as one hoped or expected, or when something bad unexpectedly happens."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1344962b-c74f-464c-968c-911780a3a7f0",
                                                "sense_id": "e9a2428e-b8a7-3a89-bd7f-1454d45569cf",
                                                "text": "Even a trip to beautiful California can cause disappointment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38fa1b73-63c0-48e6-9867-994688033896",
                                                "sense_id": "e9a2428e-b8a7-3a89-bd7f-1454d45569cf",
                                                "text": "They remembered too keenly their pleasant credulity as to what to-morrow would bring forth, to dare indulge expectation of its pleasure; they had been disappointed once—so might they be again—for disappointment ever leaves fear behind."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ef98ef3-cbda-455b-8fee-5493ed84f49b",
                                                "sense_id": "e9a2428e-b8a7-3a89-bd7f-1454d45569cf",
                                                "text": "Choking back his disappointment after his own team's splendid wins against Liverpool and Aston Villa, he said: \"I've got to be humble and say we were beaten by a very good side.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d9c5bf8-d46d-39ba-ab14-138fab5f3919",
                                        "entry_id": "dd6a4577-aaf3-3efb-9fa3-6728d356e852",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An example or the act of disappointing: a circumstance in which a positive expectation is not achieved."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25990bac-5d5a-4f71-9a35-d58ad03f7c95",
                                                "sense_id": "4d9c5bf8-d46d-39ba-ab14-138fab5f3919",
                                                "text": "The disappointment with our trip to California caused bickering."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07c99747-2233-4eca-95db-2231810410d7",
                                                "sense_id": "4d9c5bf8-d46d-39ba-ab14-138fab5f3919",
                                                "text": "For Liverpool, their season will now be regarded as a relative disappointment after failure to add the FA Cup to the Carling Cup and not mounting a challenge to reach the Champions League places."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dd9520d-29e3-41bb-b4ca-275245d405ab",
                                                "sense_id": "4d9c5bf8-d46d-39ba-ab14-138fab5f3919",
                                                "text": "As the disappointments crowded in — the economy, Rhodesia, strife within the trade-union movement — Wilson tried the expedient of a semi-formal inner Cabinet, or Parliamentary Committee, as he misleadingly liked to call it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96557a35-3812-3da2-87b0-d9c585ee8852",
                                        "entry_id": "dd6a4577-aaf3-3efb-9fa3-6728d356e852",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something or someone that disappoints: that which causes disappointment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc628c61-7f0f-4071-babb-cb16a12acf6c",
                                                "sense_id": "96557a35-3812-3da2-87b0-d9c585ee8852",
                                                "text": "Even a trip to beautiful California can be a disappointment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bce4d643-9938-4bfe-a691-85834914b491",
                                                "sense_id": "96557a35-3812-3da2-87b0-d9c585ee8852",
                                                "text": "What a disappointment!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d3a3466f-c5cf-4cb5-bcbd-3459535dea07",
                        "source_entry_id": "d6ef10f7-451b-3789-b2d1-388f8756dfdf",
                        "source_sense_id": "a87dff09-fe17-3839-998c-4f948c41624c",
                        "target_lang_word": "teleurstelling",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "teleurstelling",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc128f5a-de1c-341a-ac03-7afa703ba079",
                                        "entry_id": "15e4feae-af7a-3825-9722-f809d6680b44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een emotie opgeroepen door het niet uitkomen van een verwachting"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7651264a-3492-4ca5-8808-36cbc40261df",
                                                "sense_id": "fc128f5a-de1c-341a-ac03-7afa703ba079",
                                                "text": "Het pakje bleek een boek te bevatten dat hij al gelezen had en dat was een hele teleurstelling."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b650738-073e-44fd-a842-2d01c9287cbd",
                                                "sense_id": "fc128f5a-de1c-341a-ac03-7afa703ba079",
                                                "text": "Teleurstelling en woede bij de Arabisch-Amerikaanse gemeenschap over Trumps Midden-Oostenbeleid – maar geen spijt van stemkeuzes(!)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c8d9729-8809-4400-8def-164b53e9028f",
                                                "sense_id": "fc128f5a-de1c-341a-ac03-7afa703ba079",
                                                "text": "De dag begint. Niets aan te doen. Niets, door niets en niemand niet. Dat is nog wel het ergste, geen ochtend zonder deze allesverslindende teleurstelling: weer een dag."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a14f3204-0b64-4e67-8b40-f41ad65ae9ef",
                        "source_entry_id": "d6ef10f7-451b-3789-b2d1-388f8756dfdf",
